picoTracker Advance licensing

New original project contributions are licensed under the GNU General Public
License, version 3 only (GPL-3.0-only), unless explicitly stated otherwise.
Inherited material and third-party components retain their existing licenses.
File-specific notices and the scope described in LICENSING.md apply.

The public picoTracker v2.3.0 baseline retains its BSD-3-Clause license, except
for separately licensed components. This transition does not withdraw any
permissions granted for previously released material.

License texts:
  LICENSES/GPL-3.0-only.txt
  LICENSES/BSD-3-Clause.txt (including the preserved baseline copyright notices)

See LICENSING.md for the baseline, the treatment of mixed-license files, and
the policy for new contributions.

